<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">One backup destination is a sensible starting point, but it may share the same room, account, power, internet connection or failure as the computer. This guide is for planning a more resilient arrangement. It does not promise that three destinations will recover every file, and it does not change the current one-computer backup setup service.</p>
